WEBVTT

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:05.200
Sophomore year: career preparation,

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:09.000
networking and goal setting,
and this is on page 38.

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:15.220
It is crucial to have a clear plan
for your academic and personal goals.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:20.500
However, it is equally important
to remain flexible and open to changes.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.450
Life often requires adjustments
to your initial plans,

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.100
and being adaptable can lead
to new opportunities

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.700
and experiences that you
might not have considered.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.450
Think of your plan as a road map:

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:38.040
having a clear destination in mind
but willing to take detours when necessary.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:41.550
This flexibility will help you
manage the pressure

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.400
and expectations
that may come your way.
